flowchart TB
    subgraph access [服务接入层]
        direction LR
        P1[传输项目管理]
        P2[数据源管理]
        P3[运维监控]
        P4[告警设置]
    end

    subgraph security [横切安全]
        direction LR
        S1[Permission 权限]
        S2[Audit 审计]
        S3[Crypto 加解密]
    end

    subgraph orch [流程编排层]
        direction LR
        O1[数据库对象迁移]
        O2[数据迁移]
        O3[数据同步]
        O4[数据校验]
        O5[链路切换]
    end

    subgraph comps [组件层]
        direction LR
        C1[DBCat 转换引擎]
        C2[Store 增量拉取]
        C3[FullImport 全量导入]
        C4[IncrSync 增量同步]
        C5[FullVerification 全量校验]
        C6[AIEngine 智能辅助]
    end

    Sup[Supervisor 组件监控]

    access --> security --> orch --> comps
    C1 --- Sup
    C2 --- Sup
    C3 --- Sup
    C4 --- Sup
    C5 --- Sup
    C6 --- Sup
